I love Archs, they're my favorite because you can become expert in
silver sabre, and two-weapon Grayswandir and another sabre.  The bad
guys won't know what hit em.  They also have strong spell ability, and
are easy to play the donation game with the touchstone and pickaxe.
The second sabre can be hard to find, but there are chances in
minetown, ludios and the castle.

Personally I would wish for #1 scrolls of charging, #2 Silver dragon
scale mail, #3 speed boots, then sacrifice for Grayswandir.  Don't
waste a wish on it, it will be the first gift you receive from your
God.  The quest artifact provides magic resistance, and you can use a
cloak for backup.

The bullwhip is nearly useless against large monsters.  My main
strategy is to gain basic in scimitar or short sword early, drop the
whip and then start sacrificing for Grayswandir.

Good luck!



